  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mulit-annual programme-estimate under programme &apos;&apos;Resilience buidling and disaster response management in the Indian Ocean Region&apos;&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This multi-annual programme estimate will contribute to the implementation of specific objective 2 of the regional programme, and more specifically the results 3 and 4 : Result 3 (SO2.1): Regional tools to manage disaster risk and reduce climate change effects are improved and or developed. Result 4 (SO2.2): Strengthened preparedness for disasters risks through common mechanisms and improved coordination to reduce climate change consequences&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
